          "value": "Expressed in the endosperm and embryo 96 hours after seed imbibition. In the embryo, detected in the root meristem, the root cap, the shoot apical meristem and the epidermis of cotyledons. In adult plants, detected in roots, the whole leaf lamina, the stem and in glandular trichomes"
